      "description": "<p data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1110\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1110\">Whitney Houston – Greatest Love of All / Thinking About You</strong><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\n<p data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1303\">Original 1985 Arista Records 7-inch 45 RPM single featuring Whitney Houston's iconic hit <strong data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1227\">\"Greatest Love of All\"</strong> backed with <strong data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1265\">\"Thinking About You.\"</strong> Includes the original picture sleeve.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1383\">A classic addition to any Whitney Houston, 1980s pop, or R&amp;B vinyl collection.</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17si63v\" data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1402\">Track Listing</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1414\"><strong data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1414\">Side A</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1437\">\n<li data-section-id=\"ib3x3\" data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1437\">\nGreatest Love of All\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1449\"><strong data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1449\">Side B</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1470\">\n<li data-section-id=\"nero6\" data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1470\">\nThinking About You\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1475\">\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hrykuu\" data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1489\">Condition</h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"66qldu\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1524\"><span role=\"text\">Vinyl: <strong data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1524\">VG+ (Visual Grade)</strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1654\">\n<li data-section-id=\"13ywv10\" data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1547\">\nNice original gloss\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"113l2pv\" data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1593\">\nLight sleeve scuffs and minor surface marks\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"dsjpk0\" data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1623\">\nNo cracks or chips observed\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"vi73u1\" data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1654\">\nLabels are clean and legible\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ed8c77\" data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1688\"><span role=\"text\">Picture Sleeve: <strong data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1688\">G+ / VG-</strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1836\">\n<li data-section-id=\"ejqoq1\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1724\">\nOriginal picture sleeve included\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"tbebpi\" data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1758\">\nModerate edge wear and creasing\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"raqol6\" data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1795\">\nNoticeable wear along the top seam\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"czzyne\" data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1836\">\nGeneral shelf wear consistent with age\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1915\">Please review all photos carefully, as they are part of the item description.</p>",
